### Feature ServiceOrderItems — UPDATE (SIN AUTH)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### PUT (cantidad y peso)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 15,
  "weight_kg": 6
}

### PATCH (solo peso)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/detalle-ordenes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weight_kg": 7.5
}
